<title>USA: Britton holders approve 4-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Britton holders approve 4-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>NATCHEZ, Miss. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britton &amp; Koontz Capital Corp said Friday that shareholders at the annual meeting April 10 approved a four-for-one stock split and an increase in authorized capital stock to 12 million shares from three million.</p>
<p>The split is effective for shareholders of record April 25.</p>
</text>
